# Adopter personal-overlay slot (picked up by the install Makefile, never tracked
# here). No trailing slash so a symlinked slot is ignored too.
personal

# Default-ignore for the spec tree (R34). Nothing under specs/ is tracked here
# until positively cleared; the entry precedes the content so the first status
# after specs arrive cannot invite an `add -A`. No trailing slash, same reason as
# above. The corpus lives tracked in WhittleSpec.personal; publication is a
# deliberate act, never a default.
specs
